@model MyVoltage.Models.OperationalModels.AF_AfroxAdministration.AF_AfroxAdministrationModels.AF_AfroxAdministration_SupplyTransactionModel
@inject MyVoltage.Services.OperationalProvider opProv;
@using MyVoltage.Extensions;
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = MyVoltage.Data.SecureAreaEnum.AF_AfroxAdministration_SupplyTransaction.GetDescription();
}
<div id="loaderContent" class="loader-overlay-content">
    <div class="loader">
        <div class="text-orange text-center">
            <i class="fas fa-spinner fa-spin fa-2x"></i>&nbsp;Loading...
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div id="historyDiv" class="row mb-4">
    <div class="col">
        <div class="card p-md-1 mv-gradient">
            <div class="card-header">
            </div>
            <div class="card-body">
                <div class="row col-12">
                    <h5 class="text-orange">ACO Transaction No</h5>
                </div>
                <div class="row col-12">
                    @Html.DropDownList("ACOTransactionNo", Model.ACOTransactionNo, new { @class = "form-control", @onChange = "RedirectToFilter();" })
                </div>

            </div>
            <div class="card-footer">
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

@if (Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item != null)
{
    <div id="formDiv" class="row mb-4">
        <div class="col">
            <div class="card p-md-1 mv-gradient">
                <div class="card-header">
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <form asp-action="AF_AfroxAdministration_SupplyTransaction" enctype="multipart/form-data">
                        <input type="hidden" name="ACOTransactionNo" value="@(Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item != null ? Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item.ACOSupplyTransactionNo : "")" />

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label class="control-label">ACO Supply Transaction No</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                @Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item.ACOSupplyTransactionNo
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label class="control-label">Created Date</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                @Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item.CreatedDate.ToDateAndTimeShort()
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label asp-for="Status" class="control-label"></label>
                                (@Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item.Status)
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                @Html.DropDownList("Status", Model.Status, new { @class = "form-control" })
                                <span asp-validation-for="Status" class="text-red"></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label asp-for="SupplyStatus" class="control-label"></label>
                                (@Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item.SupplyStatus)
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                @Html.DropDownList("SupplyStatus", Model.SupplyStatus, new { @class = "form-control" })
                                <span asp-validation-for="SupplyStatus" class="text-red"></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label class="control-label">Company Name</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                @Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item.CompanyName
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label class="control-label">ACO Service Cylinder Bank</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                @Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item.ACOServiceCylinderBank
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label asp-for="ActivationDate" class="control-label"></label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <input type="datetime-local" class="form-control" asp-for="ActivationDate" />
                                <span asp-validation-for="ActivationDate" class="text-red"></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label class="control-label">No Of Cylinders</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                @Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item.NumberOfCylinders
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label class="control-label">Capacity Per Cylinder</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                @Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item.CapacityPerCylinder
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label class="control-label">Total Supply Capacity</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                @Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item.TotalSupplyCapacity
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label class="control-label">ACO Reserve Cylinder Bank</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                @Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item.ACOReserveCylinderBank
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label class="control-label">ACO Reserve No</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                @Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item.ACOReserveNumber
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label class="control-label">Metering Point</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                @Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item.MeteringPoint
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label class="control-label">Meter Serial No</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                @Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item.MeterSerialNo
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label asp-for="DepletionDate" class="control-label"></label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <input type="datetime-local" class="form-control" asp-for="DepletionDate" />
                                <span asp-validation-for="DepletionDate" class="text-red"></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-6">
                                <label class="control-label">Tamper Detection</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-6">
                                @Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item.TamperDetection.ToBoolean()
                            </div>
                        </div>



                        <div class="row mb-md-2">
                            <div class="col-12 text-right">
                                <button class="btn btn-outline-primary-sm"><i class="fas fa-save"></i>&nbsp;Save Changes</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
                <div class="card-footer">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="historyDiv" class="row mb-4">
        <div class="col">
            <div class="card p-md-1 mv-gradient">
                <div class="card-header">
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                    <div class="row col-12">
                        <h5 class="text-orange">Task History</h5>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row col-12">
                        <table class="table table-responsive-xl table-striped table-hover">
                            <tr>
                                <th>Date</th>
                                <th>User</th>
                                <th>Changes</th>
                            </tr>

                            @foreach (var item in Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item.AutoSupplyInsights_LogsItems)
                            {
                                <tr>
                                    <td>@item.DateCreated.ToDateAndTimeShort()</td>
                                    <td>@item.Username</td>
                                    <td>
                                        @(
                                            Html.Raw(string.IsNullOrEmpty(item.SystemDescription) ? "Added Comment" : item.SystemDescription)
                                            )
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            }

                            <tr>
                                <td>@Model.AF_AfroxAdministration_Item.CreatedDate.ToDateAndTimeShort()</td>
                                <td>[System]</td>
                                <td>Task Created</td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </div>

                </div>
                <div class="card-footer">
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
}

@section Scripts {
    <script>
        function RedirectToFilter() {
            document.location.href = '/operational/AF_AfroxAdministration/AF_AfroxAdministration_SupplyTransaction?ACOTransactionNo=' + $('#ACOTransactionNo').val();
        }


    </script>
}
